{"about_the_game":"<i>This is a game where you can survive, fight zombies and bandits and do all this together with a friend! The game has different weather conditions, including thunderstorms. You can move around in cars (just watch out for the mines left by your friend!)</i><br><br><strong>There are a lot of things you can do in this game, like just sit by the fire and have a heart-to-heart talk with a friend:</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839350/extras/cozy.gif?t=1729793155\" /><br><br><strong>You can drive cars, race, and just travel around in them:</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839350/extras/car.gif?t=1729793155\" /><br><br><strong>Kill bloodthirsty zombies and bandits, for protection of course)</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839350/extras/fire.gif?t=1729793155\" /><br><br><strong>The game is very funny, for example, a friend pointed a gun at me head:</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839350/extras/12345.gif?t=1729793155\" /><br><br><strong>You can also hack various doors and chests!</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839350/extras/hack.gif?t=1729793155\" /><br><br><strong>Farm to avoid starving to death:</strong><br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2839350/extras/Seeds.gif?t=1729793155\" /><br><br><i>This survival game is full of emotions and events, you will definitely not get bored in it! This demo does not have some features, but we think without them you will be able to appreciate all the advantages of this game!</i>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/